# W4 round 4: a prompt still past the window once compacted. `hello`, whose
# request the provider counts at 7 000 tokens, then a pasted prompt of 52 000
# `x`s, 13 000 tokens by the estimate on its own: past the 14 250 usable
# either way it is measured, so the turn before it is compacted (text only,
# no notes request) and the rebuilt request, still past the window, is not
# sent (`no_compactable_context`, `orchestrator.zig:7347-7350`); the turn ends
# with upstream's error line (`formatErrorBody`, `app_process_runtime.zig:113-126`).
gateway compact-toolarge-turns.json
models compact-inturn-models.json
wait 3
type hello
key Enter
wait 3
pastex 52000
key Enter
wait 3
snap refused
gwlog
